This project is an independent Rust implementation of an Oblivious HTTP
(RFC 9458) gateway. It does not contain source code copied from Cloudflare's
`privacy-gateway-server-go`, but its behavior was deliberately modeled on
that project as a functional reference, and its X25519 key-derivation
transform is intentionally byte-for-byte compatible with it (see
`docs/adr/0001-preserve-x25519-seed-derivation.md`). Portions of this
project's behavior are therefore adapted from:

